 patāma. 790."],"lineRefs":[["pv45:8"],["pv45:8"]]},{"para":3068,"vripara":"790","refs":["pv45:9"],"lines":["<b>Te cā</b>ti te mayaṃ.","<b>Uraṃ sīsañca ghaṭṭemā</b>ti avakujjā hutvā patitā uṭṭhātuṃ asakkontā vedhantā vedanāppattā attano attano uraṃ sīsañca paṭighaṃsāma.","Sesaṃ heṭṭhā vuttanayameva."],"lineRefs":[["pv45:9"],["pv45:9"],["pv45:9"]]}],"wordLinks":[["pv45:1.1","dubbaṇṇarūpātthā",0,1],["pv45:1.3","ke nu tumhetthā",0,2],["pv45:1.3","mārisā",0,3],["pv45:7.1","api yojanāni gacchāmā",25,0],["pv45:7.1","chātā āhāragedhino",25,2],["pv45:7.3","appapuññatā",25,3],["pv45:8.3","uttānā paṭikirāmā",26,0],["pv45:8.3","avakujjā patāmase",26,1],["pv45:9.1","te cā",27,0],["pv45:9.3","uraṃ sīsañca ghaṭṭemā",27,1]],"before":[{"para":3026,"vripara":null,"title":"Gaṇapetavatthuvaṇṇanā","lines":["Gaṇapetavatthuvaṇṇanā"]},{"para":3027,"vripara":null,"title":"Gaṇapetavatthuvaṇṇanā","lines":["<b>Naggā dubbaṇṇarūpātthā</b>ti idaṃ satthari jetavane viharante sambahule pete ārabbha vuttaṃ.","Sāvatthiyaṃ kira sambahulā manussā gaṇabhūtā assaddhā appasannā maccheramalapariyuṭṭhitacittā dānādisucaritavimukhā hutvā ciraṃ jīvitvā kāyassa bhedā nagarassa samīpe petayoniyaṃ nibbattiṃsu.","Athekadivasaṃ āyasmā mahāmoggallāno sāvatthiyaṃ piṇḍāya gacchanto antarāmagge pete disvā – 782."]},{"para":3029,"vripara":"782","title":"Gaṇapetavatthuvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Naggā dubbaṇarūpāttha, kisā dhamanisanthatā;"]},{"para":3030,"vripara":null,"title":"Gaṇapetavatthuvaṇṇanā","lines":["Upphāsulikā kisikā, ke nu tumhettha mārisā”ti. –"]}],"after":[{"para":3069,"vripara":null,"title":"Gaṇapetavatthuvaṇṇanā","lines":["Thero taṃ pavattiṃ bhagavato ārocesi.","Bhagavā tamatthaṃ aṭṭhuppattiṃ katvā sampattaparisāya dhammaṃ desesi.","Taṃ sutvā mahājano maccheramalaṃ pahāya dānādisucaritanirato ahosīti."]},{"para":3070,"vripara":null,"title":"Gaṇapetavatthuvaṇṇanā","lines":["Gaṇapetavatthuvaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 11."]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
